">角落绽放生命里的</span><span begin="0:39.212" end="0:39.618">花</span></p><p begin="0:39.628" end="0:42.342" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:39.628" end="0:40.428">问自己看过</span><span begin="0:40.428" end="0:40.892">什么</span> <span begin="0:41.061" end="0:41.768">问自己需要</span><span begin="0:41.768" end="0:42.141">什</span><span begin="0:42.141" end="0:42.342">么</span></p><p begin="0:42.352" end="0:45.180" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:42.352" end="0:43.434">我正在逆风而上</span> <span begin="0:43.434" end="0:44.123">创造属于</span><span begin="0:44.123" end="0:44.780">我梦里的</span><span begin="0:44.780" end="0:45.180">家</span></p><p begin="0:45.190" end="0:47.971" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:45.190" end="0:45.586">他们在</span><span begin="0:45.586" end="0:45.956">笑</span><span begin="0:45.956" end="0:46.216">我</span><span begin="0:46.216" end="0:46.563">闹</span><span begin="0:46.563" end="0:47.329">我说我还没</span><span begin="0:47.329" end="0:47.971">长大</span></p><p begin="0:47.981" end="0:50.733" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:47.981" end="0:48.830">幸福在叫</span><span begin="0:48.830" end="0:49.269">我让</span><span begin="0:49.269" end="0:49.536">我</span><span begin="0:49.536" end="0:49.862">不要</span><span begin="0:49.862" end="0:50.217">轻易</span><span begin="0:50.217" end="0:50.387">倒</span><span begin="0:50.387" end="0:50.733">下</span></p><p begin="0:50.743" end="0:53.506" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:50.743" end="0:51.296">一语就</span><span begin="0:51.296" end="0:51.643">道</span><span begin="0:51.643" end="0:51.770">破</span><span begin="0:51.770" end="0:52.163">懒</span><span begin="0:52.163" end="0:52.689">惰者的</span><span begin="0:52.689" end="0:53.042">满口</span><span begin="0:53.042" end="0:53.506">谎话</span></p><p begin="0:53.640" end="0:56.596" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:53.640" end="0:54.942">奔跑在无人的海滩</span><span begin="0:54.942" end="0:55.471">又激起</span><span begin="0:55.471" end="0:56.0